WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:02.960
*music plays*

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.080
It felt like this whole thing was going to be over...

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:12.820
but it's not.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.840
What are you going to do about that?

00:00:53.165 --> 00:00:55.235
You don't know what was happening in this photo,

00:00:56.005 --> 00:00:57.775
and you don't know what happened after.

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:00.400
We're all in this together now.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.740
Don't you know about what goes on at this school?

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.120
This is proof of who they all are.

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:07.680
The truth doesn't always make things right.

00:01:08.665 --> 00:01:10.065
It's going to keep happening.

00:01:11.575 --> 00:01:12.955
It doesn't stop.

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:17.480
There is nothing left worth having,

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:19.560
except justice for our daughter.

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:37.875
I can't count on anyone else anymore,

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:38.860
I have to do this myself.

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:39.720
You don't.

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:41.460
No one is going to get justice for her.

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:56.580
 

